e developer always has the  potential to be working on the next big  thing and become our next big Enterprise  partner  we needed a way to reach them and the  AccuWeather API developer portal powered  by apogee accomplishes that  thanks for watching this video and for  staking through the end  if you'd like to know more about apogee  or more generally API Management on  Google Cloud then check out the  resources with the links in the  description of the video  you can explore the apogee documentation  watch more in-depth demonstrations of  apogee you can even get Hands-On with  our online courses through Cloud skills  boost in particular a great lab which  guides you through deploying apis in  apogee and how they look on the  developer portal  finally don't hesitate to reach out if  you'd like to work with us on how apogee  can help your business  in the next video of this series we'll  take you through security commence  Center SEC for short some use cases of  it a demo and an inspiring customer  story  at the end we'll talk through briefly  about activeassist and how you can use  it to optimize your usage of cloud  resources  as always don't forget to like this  video And subscribe to our YouTube  channel  make sure to click on the Bell icon to  get notified every time a new video gets  posted  thank you so much and stay tuned for  more on how you can build your startup  on Google Cloud  [Music]

